	<item>
		<title>ClipFlair receives nomination for UN-based Award in Sri Lanka!</title>
		<link>../../clipflair-receives-nomination-for-un-based-award-in-sri-lanka.html</link>
		<comments>../../clipflair-receives-nomination-for-un-based-award-in-sri-lanka.html</comments>
		<pubDate>Thu, 08 Aug 2013 09:05:28 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
				<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[nominations]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WSA award]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://clipflair.net/?p=170</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[ClipFlair is one of almost 500 nominees to be examined by an international Grand Jury in the city of Tallinn/Estonia.

Patra, August 08, 2013

 ClipFlair, funded by the European Commission (EACEA, LLP-KA2)  is nominated by an international jury of ICT experts to enter the next round of the 2013 World Summit Award (WSA) in e-Learning &#038; Science. ClipFlair will compete against almost 500 outstanding e-Content products and applications from 168 countries in front of the WSA’s Grand Jury from Aug. 29 to Aug. 31 in Estonia’s capital city, Tallinn. <a href="../../clipflair-receives-nomination-for-un-based-award-in-sri-lanka.html"><div class="read-more btn btn-default"><p>Read more &#8250;</p></div><!-- end of .read-more --></a>]]></description>
		<wfw:commentRss>http://clipflair.net/clipflair-receives-nomination-for-un-based-award-in-sri-lanka/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
